  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCOC Poultry Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to train staff in good governance practices; purchase chicks; stock feed; and feeding and watering equipment; improve disease management with drugs to prevent mortality; computerize records; and improve branding and marketing.</narrative>
